repository-code: "https://github.com/brutal-45/Nexus-assistant"
url: "https://brutal-45.github.io/Nexus-assistant/"
abstract: >-
  Nexus AI (Nexus Assistant) by Viraj Jadhav (brutal-45) is an open-source,
  100% offline personal AI assistant for Android and iOS powered by React
  Native and llama.cpp (llama.rn). It runs quantized GGUF and LiteRT Large
  Language Models locally on mobile hardware with RAM-aware model tuning,
  multimodal vision, voice input, speculative decoding, hardware benchmarking,
  and zero cloud telemetry.
